DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in historical people and events?\nJoin our 
 book club where we will read a wide range of historical fiction titles.\nA
 pril 9:\nLet Us Descend\nby Jesmyn Ward\nCopies of the book will be availa
 ble on March 6.\nMay 7:\nWarlight\nby Michael Ondaatje\nCopies of the book
  will be available on April 9.\nJune 4:\nThe Piano Tuner\nby Daniel Mason\
 nCopies of the book will be available on May 7.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, In the basement program room A
