BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Colour by Number
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260526T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260526T163000
UID:69a2ff96403a4e5652ddbe37@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Colour by Numbers is an interactive colouring activity. It is 
 designed to improve your number recognition skills as you have fun with co
 lours.\nJoin us in this relaxing program and feel your artistic spirit. Th
 e most important thing is you do not have to use your brain\, just do it.\
 nAll ages. Drop-in\, No registration required.
LOCATION:Bloor/Gladstone\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a2ff96403a4e5652ddbe37
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coffee & Conversation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T143000
UID:69c7d087b48451fc3c0bc92a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization.\nDrop in for some coffee\, snacks\, and a chat wit
 h library staff\, meet other library users\, and learn about local commun
 ity organizations.\nUpcoming guest organizations:\nApril 15: New Circles\n
 May 20: AWHL Senior Safety line and Ve'ahavta\nJune 17: Mosaic Home Care
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, eLearning Lab\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c7d087b48451fc3c0bc92a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
