BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:How to Make Healthy Choices by Using Food Labels
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T150000
UID:69e51eab5c04bc0fc062d571@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, participants will learn about the different
  components of a food label and how to apply this knowledge to make health
 y and informed food choices when shopping for food. Participants will beco
 me familiar with: the Ingredient List\, the Nutrition Facts Table\, the % 
 Daily Value\, and Nutrition Claims\, which include Nutrient Content Claims
  and Health Claims.\nPresented in partnership with\nToronto Public Health
LOCATION:McGregor Park\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e51eab5c04bc0fc062d571
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
