UID:69b33ceead384e40edb3f1c1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Everyone with a smaller urban garden will benefit from these f
 un and practical ideas to expand your garden’s visual impact and intensi
 fy your garden’s yield. Includes tips on creating drama\, adding colour\
 , growing vertical\, the smart use of containers\, and adding multi-season
  plants to give your small garden greater appeal.\nThis program is present
 ed by a\nToronto Master Gardener\n.
